.Dd $Mdocdate$
.Dt EGGHEAD-SERVICE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm egghead-service
.Nd install, manage, or remove background service supervision
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm egghead service
.Cm install
.Op Fl -dry-run
.Op Fl y | Fl -yes
.Nm egghead service
.Cm uninstall
.Nm egghead service
.Cm status
.Nm egghead service
.Cm logs
.Op Fl n Ar lines
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Cm egghead serve
is a foreground process; it does not daemonize itself.
.Cm service
writes a user-scope process supervisor unit so the server starts at
login and restarts on failure, and logs to the same XDG log file
.Cm egghead logs
already reads.
.Pp
The platform branches:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It macOS
LaunchAgent at
.Pa ~/Library/LaunchAgents/computer.egghead.plist ,
label
.Sy computer.egghead .
Loaded with
.Cm launchctl bootstrap .
.It Linux
systemd user unit at
.Pa ~/.config/systemd/user/egghead.service .
Enabled and started with
.Cm systemctl --user .
.El
.Pp
When the running configuration references API keys via
.Sy {env:VAR} ,
.Cm install
offers to bake the currently-set values into the unit's environment
so the supervised process sees them without inheriting your
interactive shell.
.Pp
.Cm egghead init
offers to install the service at the end of first-run setup. The
same offer is available afterward by running
.Cm egghead service install
directly.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width "uninstall"
.It Cm install
Resolve the
.Nm egghead
binary, render the unit template, write the file, and load it.
.It Cm uninstall
Stop, unload, and remove the unit.
.It Cm status
Show the platform's native service status (output of
.Cm launchctl print
or
.Cm systemctl --user status ) .
.It Cm logs Op Fl n Ar lines
Tail the XDG log file. Alias of
.Xr egghead-logs 1 .
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--dry-run"
.It Fl -dry-run
For
.Cm install ,
print the unit that would be written without touching the filesystem.
.It Fl y , Fl -yes
For
.Cm install ,
skip confirmation prompts.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show help.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
egghead service install
egghead service status
egghead service logs
egghead service uninstall
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr egghead-serve 1 ,
.Xr egghead-logs 1 ,
.Xr egghead-doctor 1 ,
.Xr egghead 1
